<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Attendance Confirmation: {{eventName}}</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #fff;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; width: 100% !important; margin: 20px auto; padding: 0 15px; }
        .header { background-color: #10b981; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
        .content { padding: 30px 20px; background-color: #fff; }
        .manager-info { background-color: #e0f2fe; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .footer { background-color: #f3f4f6; color: #666; text-align: center; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px; }
        h1 { font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 24px); margin: 0; }
        p { margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 16px; }
        @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
            .container { margin: 10px auto; }
            .content { padding: 20px 15px; }
            p { font-size: 14px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Confirmation</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{participantName}},</p>
            <p>We are pleased to confirm your attendance at {{eventName}}.</p>
            <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact:</p>
            <div class="manager-info">
                <p style="margin-bottom: 5px;">{{eventManagerName}}</p>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">{{eventManagerContact}}</p>
            </div>
            <p>Thank you for your confirmation. We look forward to seeing you!</p>
            <p>Best regards,</p>
            <p>{{eventManagerName}}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Automated message - do not reply</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
